# TEMPLATE ONLY. Generate the concrete package file with Prepare-Homebrew.ps1.
title: SkiFreeWebOS
iconUri: "{{PUBLIC_ORIGINAL_ICON_URL}}"
manifestUrl: "{{PUBLIC_MANIFEST_URL}}"
category: game
pool: "{{PACKAGE_POOL}}"
shortDescription: "Native SkiFree 1.04 adaptation with original courses and TV controls."
description: |
  A native C++/GLES2 downhill skiing recreation for LG webOS TVs.

  Free to play, with the required gameplay artwork included. No import,
  payment or account is required. The original Windows executable is not
  included or run.

  Includes the original Slalom, Tree Slalom and Freestyle courses. Keyboard, mouse, directional remote
  and pointer input paths are implemented; check the release's tested-device list.

  Original game and artwork: Chris Pirih. This independent recreation is not
  affiliated with or endorsed by Chris Pirih, Microsoft or LG.

  [Website and optional support](https://ryanspice.com/)
  | [More from Ryan, including Champions of Snowboarding 2026]({{PUBLIC_SUPPORT_PAGE_URL}})
requirements:
  webosRelease: "{{MINIMUM_TESTED_WEBOS_RELEASE}}"
